// POSIX provider for the Windows-only `fs.mkdtemp` ACL test seam.
// POSIX callers observe the public `0700` contract through `get_perms`;
// returning false here keeps the private seam link-complete without
// pretending an NT security descriptor exists on that platform.
fn sfn_fs_mkdtemp_acl_is_private(_path: *u8) -> bool ![io] { return false; }
